// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`message templates (snapshots) > apps joined 1`] = `
"**Another app is failing with the same cause:**
- PAY - Payments Hub: errors on both sides name CIF"
`;

exports[`message templates (snapshots) > briefing 1`] = `
"## 🚨 P1: Online banking, mobile and teller customer lookups failing

**What's broken:** Customers and tellers cannot load customer profiles.
**Since:** 19:14 UTC · **Priority:** P1 (3 tier-1 apps failing)
**Incident:** [INC0010234](http://sn.test/incidents/INC0010234)

**3 apps, one incident:**

| App | Errors | Since | Team rep |
| --- | ---: | --- | --- |
| OLB Online Banking | 842 | 19:14 UTC | @aklocko2 |
| MBL Mobile Banking | 555 | 19:14 UTC | @mratke |
| TLR Teller Workstation | 133 | 19:14 UTC | — |

**Why one incident:** all 3 depend on CIF - Customer Information File, which logs no errors itself; their errors name CIF; errors: UpstreamContractError.

**Logs** (query applied):
- [1,530 errors in 3 affected apps since 19:12 UTC](http://logs.test/logs?query=f1)
- [Top signature (555): UpstreamContractError](http://logs.test/logs?query=f2)

**Likely cause (82%):** [CHG0030081](http://sn.test/change_requests/CHG0030081) → [keybank/CIF00/customer-profile-api!9](http://gl.test/mr/9) "Adopt naming standard" by @jdoe
KBR promoted it to production at 19:12 UTC. CHG0030081 promoted CIF 1m 30s before the errors started; every failing app depends on CIF.
Also looked at: ATH [CHG0030083](http://sn.test/change_requests/CHG0030083) (55%).
_Confirming in the background._

**What happens next:** I am preparing a fix merge request. When it is ready I will ask the owners to review it and click **Merge** in GitLab; I will then raise the emergency change and watch the recovery.
If one of these apps looks unrelated, say so here and I'll split it out.
Not invited yet (ask and I'll add them): dgreen (backup on-call for CIF)."
`;

exports[`message templates (snapshots) > fix, change, promotion, recovery, resolution, callers, failure 1`] = `
"**Fix ready for review:** [keybank/CIF00/customer-profile-api!10](http://gl.test/mr/10) "Revert snake_case (INC0010234)"
Strategy: revert (the change is self-contained)
@jdoe @kstreich please review and click **Merge** in GitLab. Merging deploys to QV; I'll raise the emergency change to production right after."
`;

