exports[`message templates (snapshots) > root cause confirmed and changed 1`] = `
"**Root cause confirmed (90%):** [CHG0030081](http://sn.test/change_requests/CHG0030081) → [keybank/CIF00/customer-profile-api!9](http://gl.test/mr/9) "Adopt naming standard"
Profile JSON switched to snake_case, so callers no longer find customerId.

- [CHG0030081 put CIF into production at 19:12 UTC](http://sn.test/change_requests/CHG0030081)

Ruled out: CHG0030083 ATH: bump jose (the diff has nothing to do with the errors)."
`;

